  "description": "Fuaran.Compute.Distributions — pinned probability distributions: the cumulative distribution function and the quantile of the standard normal, Student's t, the chi-square and Fisher's F distributions, each written with + − × ÷, the correctly rounded square root and the pinned special functions of Fuaran.Compute.Elementary alone, in one order, so their answers are byte-identical on .NET, under Fable and in every host that transcribes them. The one iteration, the chi-square quantile, is the pinned bracketed Newton of Fuaran.Compute.Solvers under a stated stopping rule. No fused multiply-add and no host mathematics call on any host. FSharp.Core, Fuaran.Compute.Solvers and Fuaran.Compute.Elementary only; Fable-clean.",
